---
description: Work in small chunks from the task queue
alwaysApply: true
---
- The build queue is knowledge/tasks.md. Unless told a task id, take the first unticked task in your lane.
- Do ONLY that one task. Do not start the next one, refactor unrelated code, or expand scope.
- If it will take more than about 20 minutes, split it into smaller cards in tasks.md and do only the first.
- When done: tick the box, add one line under Notes (what changed, anything the next task needs), commit with the task id in the message (for example 'UI2: light map with pins'), then stop and report in 3 lines.
- Never touch files owned by another lane without saying so in Notes.

